# React Native Component Rules

- One component per `ComponentName.tsx`; co-locate `ComponentName.styles.ts`.
- Explicit `ComponentNameProps`; destructure props in the signature.
- Named exports for reusable components; default exports only in Expo Router route files.
- Use RN primitives (`View`, `Text`, `Pressable`, `TextInput`, `Image`, `FlatList`, `SectionList`) or approved shared primitives.
- Every visible string is inside `Text`; every action is accessible.
- Handle loading, error, and empty states explicitly.
- Use `FlatList`/`SectionList` for unbounded data; `@shopify/flash-list` only after measurement.
- No DOM tags, inline object styles, NativeWind/Tailwind classes, or component-owned sockets.
